Recommended minimal structure for story payloads:

```json
{
  "id": "unique-story-id",
  "title": "Short hook title",
  "beats": [
    { "order": 1, "summary": "Inciting incident", "location": "district or location id", "featured_factions": ["Camarilla", "Setites"], "stakes": "Masquerade at risk" },
    { "order": 2, "summary": "Escalation", "complication": "Anarch cell interferes" },
    { "order": 3, "summary": "Climax / resolution options" }
  ],
  "consequences": {
    "success": ["gain_minor_boon", "status_increase"],
    "failure": ["masquerade_breach", "timeline_alarm"]
  },
  "related_agents": ["Influence Agent", "Boon Agent"],
  "tags": ["politics", "masquerade", "nightlife"]
}
```

Story Agent outputs should be deterministic yet customizable—provide scaffolding, not novels.
